{
  "schema": "treadmillrunner.golden.v1",
  "codec": "omega-z-advertisement-matcher",
  "notes": [
    "Hex strings are uppercase, no separators, wire order. 'source' = 'legacy-test' (ported verbatim from the existing automated tests), 'derived' (computed by the specified algorithm; not in the legacy tests), or 'synthetic' (constructed for coverage; not a device capture).",
    "Match if advertised local name starts with 'JFTMOmega Z' (case-insensitive), OR the name is absent/blank AND the advertised service list contains BOTH 0x1816 and 0x1826.",
    "A match only makes the device an enrollment candidate for protocol 'horizon-omega-z'. It never enables any control."
  ],
  "cases": [
